    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you reach a Druid level specified in the Circle of the Wurm Spells table, you thereafter always have the listed spells prepared. In addition, you can cast the spells from this feature while you’re in a Wild Shape form.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Druid Level</th><th>Spells</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>Acid Splash, Ray of Sickness, Acid Arrow</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>Stinking Cloud</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>Vitriolic Sphere</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>Contagion</td></tr></tbody></table><ul><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.spells.Item.cad04cc3e683f282]{Acid Splash}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.spells.Item.7c9165a748206e26]{Ray of Sickness}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.spells.Item.722d826597c06513]{Acid Arrow}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.spells.Item.dd3349e6d3987bd6]{Stinking Cloud}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.spells.Item.564dff133d5e76ec]{Vitriolic Sphere}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.spells.Item.4849e56125496251]{Contagion}</li></ul>"
